{"_id": "672d872cc576fa99e1d9ca39", "name": "Ornament Accessories", "description": "<p><strong>SPECIFICATION</strong></p><ul><li><strong>Processing Time:</strong>&nbsp;1-2 working days</li><li><strong>Shipping Time:&nbsp;</strong>7 – 15 working days average (US)</li><li><strong>Packaging:&nbsp;</strong>1x (Ornament Accessories + Main products)</li></ul><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>PRODUCTION</strong></p><ul><li>Manufacturer: Made by Printway</li><li>Tracking Country Origin is US</li></ul><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>NOTE:</strong></p><ul><li>Actual color may be slightly different from the image due to different monitor and light effects.</li><li>Please allow 0.5-2 cm&nbsp;differences due to manual measurement.</li><li><strong>Ornament Accessories will be shipped with at least one additional product. If you want to purchase them separately, please contact our support team for assistance.</strong></li></ul>", "metaKeywords": [], "guideLine": "<p><strong>Print Guidelines</strong></p><p>Below is our complete selection of art templates used for designing within the full printable area of our products. Each template comes with a .png detailing Safe Area, Bleed, etc. Download templates and mockups here:</p><ul><li><a href=\"https://printwayfulfillment.jp.larksuite.com/drive/folder/Opsgf7dd6lDnZldpNYXjPZTxpYe\">Mockup</a></li><li>Template: 500x500px, 300ppi</li></ul><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>To use an Art Template:</strong></p><ul><li>Open the Printway template for your selected product in Photoshop or another design program.</li><li>Insert your artwork in a new layer,&nbsp;<strong>placing all important parts of your design within the designated “Safe zone” on the art template</strong>&nbsp;to ensure your design will not be cut off during the printing process.</li><li>If you’re designing drinkware, use the indicated centering lines to ensure your artwork is placed exactly where you’d like.</li><li>Hide or delete the Art Template layer from your file.</li><li>Save as a .png, .jpg, or another accepted file type.</li><li>You’ve now used a Printway template to create artwork exactly to the recommended specs for that product.<ul><li>Ensure all important elements of your design are within the safe zone on the product template.</li></ul></li></ul><p><strong>To ensure your design prints properly on each product:</strong></p><ul><li><strong>Fill the entire design template!</strong>&nbsp;The outer edge of the template represents “Bleed Area,” which signifies the areas which may print on the outer edges of your product.</li><li><i><strong>Failure to fill the bleed area will likely result in unprinted white unprinted areas around the edge of your product.&nbsp;</strong></i></li></ul>", "displayPrice": {"VN": 0.15}, "mockupUrls": ["https://cdn.printway.io/lzi/672d871703feb291c613c4d8_800x800.png", "https://cdn.printway.io/lzi/672d87142da32ba2e9a2618f_800x800.jpg", "https://cdn.printway.io/lzi/672d87148158371ce390f2ae_800x800.jpg", "https://cdn.printway.io/lzi/677f6f9ed9a9e8cefcc65a03_800x800.png", "https://cdn.printway.io/lzi/672d871a9a198a3228310e82_800x800.jpg", "https://cdn.printway.io/lzi/672d8716257a06d5af8a0f71_800x800.jpg", "https://cdn.printway.io/lzi/672d872c7fc464a7341d100f_800x800.jpg", "https://cdn.printway.io/lzi/68216db60d44c8057d888297_800x800.png", "https://cdn.printway.io/lzi/6a16aa876d61dcd828a55678_800x800.png", "https://cdn.printway.io/lzi/68d50e92516b53d4398fef50_800x800.jpg", "https://cdn.printway.io/lzi/68f0ae81d90f0b7be03b31d3_800x800.jpg", "https://cdn.printway.io/lzi/68f1eb73bb4813f011dd096b_800x800.jpg", "https://cdn.printway.io/lzi/68f1eb735b8a3cda7bab40ed_800x800.jpg", "https://cdn.printway.io/lzi/68f1eb73603401e8ebdc743f_800x800.jpg", "https://cdn.printway.io/lzi/6908503c730371fb97e20674_800x800.jpg"], "videoUrls": "", "templateArtworksUrl": null, "processingTime": {"from": 1, "to": 3}, "location": [{"locationId": "64055ad76d933e2c5d8dd764", "isEnabledTiktok": true, "name": "Made in VN", "code": "VN", "default": true, "suppliers"